```sh
$ gimbal run --help
Available Commands:
  implement         Implement modifies a repository until its promise is independently demonstrated.
  pyramid-summary   PyramidSummary writes and validates every derived compression of a largest document.
  research-document ResearchDocument produces a research-backed document within a token budget.
  review            Review asks one reviewer to inspect the repository read-only and record its findings.
  validate-product  ValidateProduct runs user workloads, checks screenshots, and triages findings.
```
